    "prompt": "A steady drawn anime two-shot holds the real seated pair in the unchanged blue kitchen. Behind them, one tall translucent gold plane contains a warm ordinary morning. The plane slowly folds toward edge-on so that its visible warm room narrows naturally into a thin vertical golden line. Other faint gold reflections recede with it. The two solid people, their own hands and the table remain grounded and coherent throughout; the two cream mugs stay fixed and their handles retain their pictured screen-left orientation. She keeps her eyes closed or downward while his worried eyes continue searching. Finish with only the slender gold line and their quiet separate breathing.",
